%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: BleakFallsSanctum
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418961
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, {mc}? How much further do we have to go?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955926
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We <i>should</i> be over halfway there. So not too much longer.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, how many times have you been in this place before?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955927
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Literally? Only once.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Through a player character? 35 times.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Kind of surprised no one asked that sooner...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955928
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: After a couple more minutes of dungeoneering, we encounter the claw door.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955930
    - rid: 9079475098267418962
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: This door is what we need the claw for.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Why does it have a bunch of animals on it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955931
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because the ancient Nords decided to make all of their combination locks
      use animals for symbols, I guess.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: They could've very easily been the letters/symbols of the dragon language-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Huh!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Why <i>don't</i> these doors use the dragon language?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That way you could have an actual password that the people the dragons
      intend to unseal these places would know, but no one else would.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Is there something important behind this door?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955932
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, yeah. The Dragonstone. That thing we came here for.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But you can find these kinds of doors in basically every single Nordic
      ruin here in Skyrim.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: So do those ruins have something important inside of them?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Powerful draugr, riches, and magical artifacts, mostly.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Also, probably significant cultural insights, but the societies of Tamriel
      don't care about that nearly as much as the other stuff I mentioned.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So how do we open this thing?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955933
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, we make the symbols above the claw hole match the symbols on the
      claw itself.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, so why even have this symbol-matching nonsense?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955934
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: If you have the claw, you could just open the door using just that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So why not just use a key or something, it would basically be the same.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... heh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I appreciate that you noticed that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955935
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So I'm pretty sure the real reason it's like that is because the game
      designers wanted a cool puzzle-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And there isn't really a reason to use the in-game menus to examine an
      object-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So they decided to give that "neat but pointless" feature a gameplay
      purpose.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Lorewise, it's because the claw doors aren't meant to keep people out,
      but the powerful draugr in.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: But that's dumb!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955937
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: For as deep as the Elder Scrolls' lore runs, I will never claim that
      Skyrim is the most intelligently-written game.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So yeah, it is kind of dumb.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, let's get this door open, shall we?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955938
    - rid: 9079474908378955939
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I successfully spin the right combination, and open the claw door.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418963
    - rid: 9079475089592287506
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, does something bad happen if you mess up the claw door combination?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955942
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Like a fireball coming from the wall?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955943
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Or a big trapdoor opening up from underneath you?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Or a big dragon skeleton head falls on you?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Some poison darts come from the wall, but that's about it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And I'm pretty sure it's possible to just sit in a corner or something
      where you can't be hit by them...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You'd probably make a better designer for these traps than the ancient
      Nords, Sayori.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Really?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955945
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, your creativity <i>trounces</i> theirs.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, aren''t there only 27 possible combinations for those doors?'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Isn't that really insecure as far as passwords go?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure, but the claw makes it pointless, as Natsuki said earlier, anyway.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess you're right-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955946
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Eeek!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955947
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Some bats fly from overhead, going past us.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You scared of bats, Sayori?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955950
    - rid: 9079474908378955951
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: No...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955948
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: They just startled me, that's all!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955949
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... alright.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474908378955953
    - rid: 9079474908378955954
    - rid: 9079474908378955955
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So? Where's this Dragonstone?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474934013755392
    - rid: 9079474934013755393
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, you see that elevated platform with the curved wall?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There's a powerful draugr up there that has it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Powerful? There's still five of us, and one of it, though!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I guess you're right.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We make our way to the heart of the sanctum.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474934013755445
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418964
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't see any draugr over here...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474934013755447
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: He should be in that coffin right over there.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: So do we have to open it, or what?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474934013755448
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, in the original game-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The coffin opens when the player character learns the word of power...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hold on, let me stare at this wall for a bit.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Wha-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474934013755449
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I stare at the word wall, hoping to find... something.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287507
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <Speed=1>...</Speed>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: There doesn't seem to be-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Here lies the guardian, Keeper of the Dragonstone, And a <SineText=5>force</SineText>
      of unending, rage and darkness.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Huh, I didn't know that's what it-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The coffin behind me bursts open; the Draugr Overlord seems to have noticed
      my impecable literacy.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287508
    - rid: 9079474934013755452
    - rid: 9079474934013755453
    - rid: 9079474934013755454
    - rid: 9079474934013755455
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Time to give this punk the business! Hopefully!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474934013755463
    - rid: 9079474934013755464
    - rid: 9079474934013755465
    - rid: 9079474934013755466
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575114
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The Draugr Overlord recovers from our onslaught, leans back, and-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118673552507045
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a28c7bf68c4fd8649a26f5576848dacc, type: 2}
    dialog: Good sir, you are very disrespectful!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a28c7bf68c4fd8649a26f5576848dacc, type: 2}
    dialog: fus ro <NoiseText=3,1>d4</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796386
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hey, I know what this one means!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The blue wave force comes crashing towards me, I try to get out of the-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Grk-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418965
    - rid: 4972360475574796387
    - rid: 4972360390599770165
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It <SineText=3>seems</SineText> that my <SineText=10>head</SineText>
      has been shoved into a rock!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Rather... <SineText=5>forcefully</SineText>...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}!'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh <SineText=2>goody</SineText>!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: That there <SineText=6>boneman</SineText> wishes to begin round 2.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: So be it, ho ho!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575118
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Most <SineText=5>wonderful</SineText>! Our most <SineText=2>dreadful</SineText>
      foe has been defeated!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287509
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah, my <SineText=5>friends have</SineText> <NoiseText=3,1>come to commend
      me on my <SineText=3>stellar</SineText> work.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575119
    - rid: 9079474951791575121
    - rid: 9079474951791575124
    - rid: 9079474951791575125
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh, our dear <SineText=4>Sayori is try</SineText>ing to give me a <SineText=3>hug</SineText>!
      <SineText=20>Marvelous</SineText>!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, Sayori, are you healing him or wha-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm <NoiseText=3,1>trying, okay</NoiseText>?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575132
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, <SineText=4>Sayori</SineText>, you <i>always</i> do a marvelous job
      <SineText=5>with your</SineText> hugs, why <SineText=7>I just feel dandy</SineText>!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: In <SineText=2>fact</SineText>-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} falls over, unconscious.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575133
    - rid: 9079475089592287510
    - rid: 4972360475574796388
    - rid: 9079475098267418966
    - rid: 9079475098267418967
    - rid: 9079474951791575139
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <NoiseText=1,1>Uwaaaah</NoiseText>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287511
    - rid: 9079474951791575141
    - rid: 9079474951791575142
    - rid: 9079474951791575143
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Here, Sayori, let me check his pulse...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575144
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori sniffles, but lets Monika get close to {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575145
    - rid: 9079474951791575146
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, let's see here...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575147
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika places her fingers on {mc}'s wrist after taking off his hand's
      protection.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575148
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: She couldn't feel anything, but it was possible that the pulse was just
      too faint.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Gimme a hand with taking his top off, girls.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575150
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Heh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575149
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Despite the potential humorousness of taking what Monika said out of
      context, the other girls get down and give her the help she asked for.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575151
    - rid: 9079474951791575152
    - rid: 9079474951791575153
    - rid: 9079474951791575154
    - rid: 9079474951791575155
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you~!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Once {mc}'s shirt is off (heh) the other three girls stand back up.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575156
    - rid: 9079474951791575157
    - rid: 9079474951791575158
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With his supple chest now exposed, Monika places her ear onto {mc}'s
      chest; about where his heart should be.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575159
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287512
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Good news, everyone!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575160
    - rid: 9079474951791575162
    - rid: 9079475089592287513
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} still has a heartbeat.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: It may be a bit faint, but it's pretty steady and seems to have a good
      BPM.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575163
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: BPM?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Beats per minute, Natsuki.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: W-what should we d-d-do, Monika?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Where should we take {mc}?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575165
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (There any healers there or something?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575164
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Hmm. Getting him to a bed is probably a good idea...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, everyone!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575166
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: First, Natsuki, you get the Dragonstone from that draugr.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575167
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, why me?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575168
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Because Yuri and Sayori are going to help me carry {mc}.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Where will we be taking him?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Back to Riverwood; there should be an inn there where he can get the
      rest he needs to recover.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: C'mon Sayori, Yuri. No time like the present!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575169
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The three girls reach down and start carrying {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575170
    - rid: 9079474951791575171
    - rid: 9079474951791575172
    - rid: 9079474951791575173
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki searches the Draugr Overlord, finding the Dragonstone, but-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575174
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ack! It's heavy-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575175
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Chip-chop, Natsuki! We've got places to be!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Grr-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575176
    - rid: 9079474951791575177
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika, do you really think he's going to be okay?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418968
    - rid: 9079474951791575183
    - rid: 9079474951791575184
    - rid: 9079474951791575185
    - rid: 9079474951791575186
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, I'm sure he'll be fine.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Probably.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575187
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418969
    - rid: 9079474951791575190
    - rid: 9079475089592287514
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: What the hell?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575191
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: How are we supposed to get down from here?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, carefully?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575193
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575194
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Don't look at me like that, ahaha...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575195
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-um, do you think we can, maybe, head over to our right and-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575196
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: <Speed=1>...</Speed>
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575197
    - rid: 9079474951791575198
    - rid: 9079474951791575199
    - rid: 9079474951791575200
    - rid: 9079475098267418970
    - rid: 9079475098267418971
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Grnh-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287515
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575204
    - rid: 9079474951791575206
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh? Wha-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sayori all but tackles me in a hug.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Fwah-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori, you're hurting him!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575207
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, sorry...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575208
    - rid: 9079474951791575210
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I've got several questions...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Where are the other two?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki and Monika?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575211
    - rid: 9079474951791575212
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, Monika decided that the two of them should deliver the Dragonstone
      back to the Jarl while the two of us kept an eye on you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, uh, what happened to me? Based on the throbbing pain in my head,
      I must've gotten hurt, right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, yeah...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575213
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575214
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What's the last thing you remember, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575215
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well... we were fighting the Draugr Overlord...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We knocked him back a bit...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: He said something completely incomprehensible, and then...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, right. I was slammed into a rock, head first.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Makes sense.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, uh, we got him, right? If Monika and Natsuki have the Dragonstone...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, you actually fought all the way until the draugr died.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: You collapsed shortly after it was defeated.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575216
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, I'm sorry to worry you guys...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: How long have I been out, anyway?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Only a few hours.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: A... few hours?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I'm not sure whether to feel relieved or concerned...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, it's about suppertime now!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575217
    - rid: 9079474951791575218
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... do we have the septims for that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika made sure to equally divide our money before leaving, don't worry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575219
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, okay...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So is this room paid for, or-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually, the inn-keeper was nice enough to let you lay around after
      he saw your condition?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: He? Which inn are we at, anyway?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: The one in Riverwood, I believe it is called <i>The Sleeping Giant Inn</i>.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Odd... Delphine's the inn-keeper and she-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: She...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: At this part of the game, she should be chilling with Farengar while
      the player delivers the Dragonstone.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess Monika and Natsuki are gonna experience some quality foreshadowing-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Wait a minute!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287516
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Once they deliver that Dragonstone...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The dragon, whatever his stupid name is, is going to attack the Western
      Watchtower!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And since I'm pretty sure I'm the Dragonborn...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And they got a headstart on us...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We need to go now- grk!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287517
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I try to get up from my bed but, as it turns out, concussions make that
      a bit more difficult than it needs to be.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575221
    - rid: 9079474951791575222
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, no- what are you doing?'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: As much -grk- as I would like to rest -gah!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We don't... have time for that!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: W-what do you mean?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575225
    - rid: 9079474951791575226
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Pretty soon, Natsuki and Monika are going to be fighting a dragon, and
      they'll need our help!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: A... dragon?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575227
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, none of you have experienced one yet...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'But remember, the place I woke up at is now a smoldering ruin. '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: All thanks to a <i>single</i> dragon.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575228
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Th-then...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: We'll go. You stay here, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575229
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... ha!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: See, Natsuki? I'm not the only one playing hero-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Remember, dragons can only truly die when a Dragonborn consumes their
      soul.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575231
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And if I'm a betting man, that's me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: U-uh, how would you know?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575230
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You remember the wall I stared at back in the barrow before we fought
      the draugr?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, all those symbols on it were of the dragon language.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>Which I could read</i>.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Non-dragonborns can't just do that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Much to their chagrin, I finish my ascent from the bed.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... hoo boy...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I take some deep breaths to try and help clear the fuzz out of my head.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It helps a little...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418972
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, we're heading to the Western Watchtower.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I can't stop you, can I...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575233
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Oh come on, look on the bright side:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You get to take care of me on the way there!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575234
    - rid: 9079474951791575235
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079474951791575236
    - rid: 9079474951791575237
    - rid: 9079475089592287518
    - rid: 9079475098267418973
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
